    "sentence_translations": [
      "Girl Pushed Into River by Mother",
      "",
      "Recently, an internet user uploaded a video showing a 40 year old woman grabbing the hand of a girl wearing a school uniform, ..",
      ".. and trying to push the girl into the river; all while the girl is crying heartbrokenly.",
      "Throughout the video, the woman keeps saying \"Why won't you study properly? Do you want to die? If you want to die let's die together.\"",
      "The user who uploaded the video said: \"Perhaps the girl's exam score was too bad, and she is being pushed into the river by her mother.\"",
      "",
      "A lot of internet users did not agree with the woman's behavior, and were scolding her online. "
    ]
